  "content": "\n\n<p>rotrBLOCKS 是一款 PBR/POM 材质包，它不会改变你的原版风格，而是会让它变得更好！</p>\n<h2>你可以在<span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fillystray.com%252fselect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Boosty</a></span>&nbsp;或 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fillystray.com%252fselect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></span><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fboosty.to%252fillystray%253fpostsTagsIds%253d31245\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">|</a><br><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fillystray.com%252fcurseforge-rotrblocks-site\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方网站</a></span>找到 256-512x 版本</h2>\n<p>CTM 和其他附加组件可在<span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fillystray.com%252faddons%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a></strong></span>找到&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong>每月更新，分别在 2 号和 16 号</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>材质包有任何问题吗？请查阅<span style=\"color:#f60\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fillystray.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">常见问题解答（FAQ）</a></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>欢迎加入我们的<span style=\"color:#f60\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/H6Rcd3y\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span>！</strong></p>\n<h2>1.21.10 版本更新现已发布！</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c746b73b0054cf0974d25280c78a1ac79ffeff96.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cc49dd1256a01631d7cc4936fdc13f6a7eb8c6c3.webp\" alt=\"截图\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/db66e19186e06d50d10155df8b3252b8f80f247f.webp\" alt=\"截图\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4b7